why Every Horde quest of Alcaz Prison in one run, lead-ins included.

# Alcaz Prison's Horde quests in one guide: Nazeer Bloodpike's lead-in,
# Sergeant Ulka on Alcaz Island, one run through the prison, then the
# hand-ins on the island, in Westfall and in Orgrimmar. Steps already done are
# passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain stands.
#
# The chain: Nazeer Bloodpike's 95284 The Elite of the Elite (to Sergeant
# Ulka) -> 95285 Right Place, Wrong Time -> 95309 No Orc Left Behind (to
# Commander Folkar inside), 96332 A Little Payback (Strashaz naga and
# Tidemistress Ca'zass's head) and 96334 Blood Red Bandanas (for Eitrigg).
# Inside: Folkar's 95454 The Honor of the Kor'kron -> 96369 Bad News for
# Folkar -> 95483 Thrall Needs to Know, for Thrall. The prisoner Mason
# Connery's 96335 The Man in the Iron Chains (the Ornate Shackle Key from The
# Questioner) -> 96337 More Valuable Than Gold (Connery's Trunk in Westfall)
# -> Nazgrel's 96376 State Secrets (a Document Box).
#
# Left out: nothing of the Horde's.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses, Folkar or Mason Connery
# inside, so their goals stand at the door (@75.4,14.0, Alcaz Island) with
# `group 5`. The bosses come in the order of the client's dungeon journal
# (Overseer Wrex, Tidemistress Ca'zass, Katerina the Cleaner, The Questioner,
# Blazeroar), not of a recorded run; the journal ties No Orc Left Behind to
# Katerina and The Honor of the Kor'kron to Blazeroar, so Folkar's steps sit
# there. Every quest goal is counted by the quest log, so a group that takes
# them in another order still gets each step ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. The Shackle Key is a quest item there: it
#   drops only while Mason's quest is in the log.
# - Players' recordings, as Polestar holds them (data/codex/journal-quests.json):
#   Folkar's three quests taken and handed in inside, Thrall Needs to Know
#   taken inside, Mason's two quests taken inside and the trunk in Westfall,
#   the bandanas from the human guards inside.
# - The door, and the elite Strashaz naga of level 59 to 61 around it:
#   players' recordings (data/codex/entrances.json) and the data's spawns.
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   48 to 55).
# INGAME: where inside do Commander Folkar and Mason Connery stand? Where does
#   the Document Box for State Secrets come from? The data has no source for
#   it, so its step only applies while the box is in your bags.

step Nazeer Bloodpike
  tip In the Barrens.
  accept 95284

step Sergeant Ulka
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip On Alcaz Island, off north-eastern Dustwallow.
  turnin 95284
  accept 95285

step Sergeant Ulka
  turnin 95285
  accept 95309
  accept 96332
  accept 96334

step To Alcaz Prison
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 48 to 55. Elite Strashaz naga of level 59 to 61 crowd the island around the door.
  enter "Alcaz Prison" @75.4,14.0

step Naga and bandanas
  along until leave
  kill 255995 x15 quest 96332.1 @75.4,14.0 group 5
  kill 255373 x8 quest 96332.2 @75.4,14.0 group 5
  collect 274028 x8 quest 96334.1 @75.4,14.0 group 5 -- The human guards drop them.

step Tidemistress Ca'zass
  tip Overseer Wrex comes before her in the client's journal. She drops her head for Sergeant Ulka.
  collect 273883 quest 96332.3 @75.4,14.0 group 5

step Commander Folkar
  tip The client's journal ties him to Katerina the Cleaner, the third boss.
  turnin 95309 @75.4,14.0
  accept 95454 @75.4,14.0

step Mason Connery
  tip A prisoner. Take his quest before The Questioner dies: the key drops only while it is in your log.
  accept 96335 @75.4,14.0

step The Questioner
  tip The fourth boss in the client's journal. He drops the Ornate Shackle Key.
  collect 274029 quest 96335.1 @75.4,14.0 group 5

step Mason Connery
  turnin 96335 @75.4,14.0
  accept 96337 @75.4,14.0

step Blazeroar
  tip The last boss. The client's journal ties The Honor of the Kor'kron to him: what became of King Varian, back to Folkar.
  turnin 95454 @75.4,14.0
  accept 96369 @75.4,14.0

step Commander Folkar
  turnin 96369 @75.4,14.0
  accept 95483 @75.4,14.0

step Before you leave
